!<br><br>Throw techniques can be varied with key inputs. Send your targeted enemies flying, and if you throw them into the background, you can destroy normally unreachable objects, giving you a chance to acquire items!<br><br>As you land hits or take damage, your rage gauge increases. When the gauge reaches MAX, you enter rage mode. In addition to enhanced attack and defense abilities, you'll also be able to unleash a finishing move called &quot;Beat Rush.&quot; Overcome evil with the power of righteous fury!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/d7e83de522dcac1162b1c8adc57f8900.poster.avif?t=1767848656\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/d7e83de522dcac1162b1c8adc57f8900.webm?t=1767848656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/d7e83de522dcac1162b1c8adc57f8900.mp4?t=1767848656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6CHAPTER</h2>Battle across varied locales: in shopping malls, slums, subways, and research facilities as you fight to uncover the truth and save the city once more! Challenge side-missions along the way, with challenges involving various actions and stage gimmicks!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/5e48e42f3cf0d44295e8d74967588e24.poster.avif?t=1767848656\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/5e48e42f3cf0d44295e8d74967588e24.webm?t=1767848656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488290/extras/5e48e42f3cf0d44295e8d74967